User-invoked /payoff reads a batch of tickets (explicit ids, parent issue,
milestone, wayfinder map, or local feature slug) and the code it touches,
then delivers the delta between now and the last ticket closing — every
claim traceable to the ticket that delivers it. Read-only; answers in the
language the question was asked in.

Registers the skill per AGENTS.md: bucket README, top-level README,
plugin.json, changeset, docs page, and the ask-matt router.
